# v1.0.1

## English

### Highlights

- **New Lighting Filter** — Physically-based spot light effect for both video and image filters, with adjustable light color, cone angle, soft edge (penumbra), distance decay, pendulum swing animation, and full keyframe support.

### New Features

#### Lighting Filter
- Spot light simulation with realistic intensity falloff and soft shadow edges
- Parameters: Light color, brightness, cone angle, penumbra (edge softness), decay, max distance, ambient light
- Light direction: Down / Up / Left / Right; light position freely adjustable (can extend beyond image edges)
- Two scenes: Vertical (wall) and Horizontal (floor)
- Pendulum swing animation: rope length, gravity, swing amplitude, damping
- Full keyframe animation support for all lighting parameters
- Available in both **Video** and **Image** filters (backed by the new `lib/lighting` rendering engine)

#### MusicGen
- Exported audio is now automatically added to the playlist
- Cancel now properly clears generated samples, duration and player state

### Improvements

- **Settings validation for AI tool dialogs** (Background Remover, Clear Vision, Deep Filter, Dewatermark, MusicGen, Stem Splitter): export directory input highlights in red when the path does not exist
- **Similar Video Segment & Speakers dialogs**: settings dialog auto-opens when the configuration is invalid; invalid inputs are highlighted; similarity threshold is now clamped to 0-1
- **TTS dialog**: reorganized model section layout; fixed save-dir validation (previously wrongly checked the model dir)
- Font dialog closes automatically after picking a font
- Track header insert-menu item order adjusted; export panel layout simplified
- Performance: snap position search rewritten from linear scan to **binary search**; snap is now only searched after the mouse moves beyond the snap threshold (previously on every mouse move)
- Audio waveform display sample rate reduced from 30 Hz to 15 Hz (lighter UI load)
- Linux: main thread stack size raised to 32 MB via linker flags
- Dependency upgrades: rmcp 2→3, base64 0.22→0.23, syn 2→3; new `glam` dependency

### Bug Fixes

- **FFmpeg encoder**: fixed garbled/corrupted video (花屏) when exporting with a width that is not 32-byte aligned (e.g. 854x480) — frames are now copied row-by-row using the real plane stride
- **Bot (LLM chat)**: fixed garbled Chinese/UTF-8 text when a multi-byte character was split across network chunks — SSE stream is now parsed on raw bytes; also added CRLF framing support and handling for streams that close without a `[DONE]` marker
- **Track background misalignment**: track background now spans the full timeline (longest track duration) instead of the individual track duration
- **MusicGen**: fixed race conditions where stale callbacks could overwrite UI state of a newer generation run
- **AppImage packaging**: fixed wrong path for the appdata.xml file

